      "writtenOn": "2025-04-01T09:13:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is fine enough, but you could considerably simplify it by having the transport type taken in `cellNc` (and rename it to `makeNc`) and just passing transportType to it here ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 376,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 376,
        "endChar": 11
